# Nocked — App Architecture

## What This App Is
Nocked is a compound archery tuning, coaching, and scoring platform. It guides archers from bare bow setup through full tuning, form coaching, shot analysis, and 3D/indoor/outdoor scoring. MVP is compound only, iOS primary.

---

## Module List

| Module | Status | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Onboarding | MVP | Archer profile, bow/arrow/release profile, tool inventory |
| Home Screen | MVP | Session launcher, bow switcher, module nav, tuning status |
| Setup Phase | MVP | 12-step bare bow to shoot-ready guide |
| Form Module | MVP | 8 form components with SVG animations |
| Standard Tuning | MVP | 6 methods: sight-in, peep final, paper, walk-back, bare shaft, broadhead |
| Advanced Tuning | MVP | 4 methods: group, torque, third axis fine, draw length fine |
| Diagnostics | MVP | Cam timing, string replacement, peep rotation, rest issues |
| Scoring Module | MVP | All formats, course builder, arrow plot, KWM, custom scoring |
| Performance Overview | MVP | Avg per target trends, course-specific target trends, heat map |
| Shot Analyzer | MVP | Phase 1 manual guided review — 6 form components |
| Settings | MVP | Tool inventory, form reminders, units, handedness, bow profiles |
| Social / Leaderboards | Phase 2 | Requires Supabase backend and user accounts |
| Shot Analyzer AI | Phase 2 | MediaPipe pose detection — post MVP |
| Coaching Marketplace | Phase 3 | Coach review of shot videos |

