## Phase Boundaries

**MVP (build now):**
- Everything in the Module List marked MVP
- Local SQLite only — no backend
- No user accounts required
- No social features
- No AI detection in Shot Analyzer

**Phase 2 (post-launch, post-traction):**
- Supabase backend
- User accounts (required for social features only)
- Social scoring features
- Shot Analyzer AI (MediaPipe)
- RevenueCat payments

**Phase 3:**
- Coaching marketplace
- Brand partnerships / affiliate links

---

## Key Constraints
- Handedness (RH/LH) from profile flips all left/right instructions throughout app
- Release type from profile drives anchor and release instructions
- Rest type from profile drives which setup/tuning steps are shown
- Bow make/model from profile drives all database lookups — never ask user to look up what app already knows
- If bow/sight/rest not in database — show generic instructions + prompt to consult owner's manual
- All units respect Imperial/Metric setting from profile
